@using jeanie.Lib
@model jeanie.Models.ReservationViewModel

<p>Hi @Model.Name.FirstWord()!</p>

<p>Thank you for completing your reservation for <b>@Model.FormattedTimeSlot</b>.</p>

<p>You'll receive an email reminder @System.Configuration.ConfigurationManager.AppSettings["HoursNotice"] hours before you're scheduled to meet.</p>

<p>Add to your calendar so you don't forget! <a href="@jeanie.Lib.CalendarHelpers.GoogleLink(Model)">Google</a> | <a href="@jeanie.Lib.CalendarHelpers.AppleLink(Model)">Apple</a> | <a href="@jeanie.Lib.CalendarHelpers.OutlookLink(Model)">Outlook</a></p>

<p>Additionally, see attached files for information regarding parking instructions and directions to our lab which is in the College of Human Sciences. You may also, if you wish, read over the detailed letter and consent form regarding our study. We look forward to your visit!</p>